ss=\"story\">\n    <h2>Why “Corner Pane”?<\u002Fh2>\n    <p>The window pane of a corner ground floor unit — combining the unbeatable drive-thru experience with warmth, smiles, and products made with a whole lot of Love.<\u002Fp>\n    <h2>Small batch, made to order<\u002Fh2>\n    <p>There’s no cafe and no middleman. We source ceremonial-grade matcha, sift it by hand, and whisk every cup fresh the day you pick it up. Fruit purees, syrups, and creams are all homemade in small batches — no shortcuts, no food coloring.<\u002Fp>\n    <h2>Pop-ups &amp; community<\u002Fh2>\n    <p>You’ll also spot us at weekend markets, fairs, and collabs around Punggol. We love meeting new matcha and coffee friends — come say hi, and follow us on <a href=\"https://instagram.com/cornerpane\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7C8C4A;font-weight:700\">Instagram<\u002Fa> to catch our next pop-up.<\u002Fp>\n  <\u002Fsection>\n\n  <section class=\"tl\">\n    <h2>Where we've popped up<\u002Fh2>\n    <div class=\"tl-track\">\n      <div class=\"tl-line\"><\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"792ee2cb-18a1-4651-8795-bed98aef2f92\" alt=\"School Canteen Vendor — Rayner Tan\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 00<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>School Canteen Vendor — Rayner Tan<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>How it all began; an idea, a dream, a decision that the canteen culture was worth fighting for.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row flip\">\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 01<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>Home Based Business —<br>through the pane<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>We wanted to create a common space, a community, a friendly neighborhood. And there wasn't anywhere else better.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"1bddb188-102f-4a12-8918-df1e06c2174c\" alt=\"Home Based Business — through the pane\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"420ca71d-7ca4-43e4-9d82-5a3f44d7dcb6\" alt=\"Our very first pop-up\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 02<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>Our very first pop-up<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>CornerPane X Elevate — going back to our annual youth church conference not as attendees, but as servers, supporters, providing the caffeine boost everyone needed.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row flip\">\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 03<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>Pop-up at Katong Shopping Center<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>Beyond the window into the heartlands —<br>took a brave step into heritage, culture and community;<br>bringing refreshing, bold flavours to new patrons.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"d8069fdb-3d7c-431c-b262-e8d46ab30263\" alt=\"Pop-up at Katong\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"7a261d66-2e03-44e6-916d-a8d8a8df5773\" alt=\"Wedding cart\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 04<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>Wedding cart<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>Joyous occasions made better with the couple's favourite speciality drinks — catering fresh cups through our live matcha bar experience.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row flip\">\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 05<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>Collab with F45<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>We teamed up with F45 Training to serve matcha right at their studio — fuelling the fitness crowd, which kickstarted our protein matcha and sugar-free syrup options. Because protein adds up, and sometimes you don't have enough calories to pay with.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"20706705-383e-49f3-b1c5-7e2f9b0079a8\" alt=\"Collab with F45\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"media\"><figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"9b3c62ec-5480-4095-a11a-55a5f09117b8\" alt=\"Corporate Events\"><\u002Ffigure><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"dot\"><span><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">CHAPTER 06<\u002Fdiv>\n          <h3>Corporate Events<\u002Fh3>\n          <p>Everyone knows the feeling of your cup half empty, especially at work. We were there to fill all cups to the brim with delicious matcha.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fsection>\n\n  <section class=\"cta\">\n    <h2>Ready for a cup?<\u002Fh2>\n    <p>Pre-order on Take-App or find us on Grab.<\u002Fp>\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\n      <a href=\"#menu\" style=\"background:#EFC13F;color:#4A3423\">See the Menu<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"https://take.app/cornerpane\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#4A3423;color:#EFC13F\">Order on Take-App<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fsection>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <img src=\"c95d8065-89f8-4534-9b7c-8204cb01079c\" alt=\"Corner Pane\">\n    <div><a href=\"https://instagram.com/cornerpane\" target=\"_blank\">@cornerpane<\u002Fa> · Open Mon–Sat, 9am–2:30pm<\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Ffooter>\n\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var h=document.getElementById('page-home